        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BPRK125, Solid Brass Cabinet Knob Base Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDress up your <a href=\"/collections/deltana-cabinet-hardware\"><b>Deltana cabinet hardware</b></a> with this 1-1/4\" diameter flat base plate. This flat plate can be used behind cabinet pulls, wall mounted door stops, or cabinet knobs for a high-end look. Available in 8 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-BPRK125-size.gif?v=1704354722\" width=\"416\" height=\"158\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BPRK125 Base Plate Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana BPRK125 Base Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Diameter: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection:  3/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Style: Flat with Beveled Edge</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BPRK125.pdf?v=1691095269\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  BPRK125 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the plate will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>.\r\n</p>",
